WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm moves from its home position to the left, approaching the dark-colored rounded dish on the table. It lowers its open gripper to grasp the dish from above, lifts it, and moves it to the right to place it on top of the white plate with a red rim.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Move arm towards the dark-colored dish and lower the gripper to grasp it

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Lift the dish and move it to the right over the white plate

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Lower the dish onto the white plate and release the grasp
